Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.64,0:22:53.34,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Everybody, cooking in 30 seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.93,0:22:58.64,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki's mom made me a perfect gruel for a cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.64,0:23:03.36,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,You start with konbu soup, than you put in carrots, mushrooms, pumpkin, and onion.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.36,0:23:06.32,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Then you cut in small pieces of potato and boil it gently.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.97,0:23:10.45,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Then you take it from the fire and season it with salt and soy sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.45,0:23:14.62,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Last you put in the rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.16,0:23:17.75,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,The next story is "Stomach Flu."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.75,0:23:19.03,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Please eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.97,0:01:39.23,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}ashita no koto wa wakannai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.23,0:01:42.65,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kore tte gisei to wa chigau
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.65,0:01:44.35,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}nanika ga chigau
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.35,0:01:47.97,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}batsu ge-mu ja nante omowanai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.97,0:01:51.22,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}de nande na no ka wa wakannai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.22,0:01:54.62,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}chotto shakuzen to shinai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.62,0:02:00.17,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kimi no sonzai ima daiji da nante mon ja nai
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.67,0:02:06.43,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}owaranai koto nante kono yo no doko ni mo nai
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.54,0:02:10.98,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}naku no wa tsurain ja nai no
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.98,0:02:13.68,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}ai no Sweet Drops, Sweet Drops
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.68,0:02:17.12,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}zutto yume mite itai ne
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.12,0:02:20.25,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}motto yasashiku shitai ne
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.64,0:02:24.01,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kimi to iraretara Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.01,0:02:27.23,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}onna no ko tte tsuyoi ne
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.23,0:02:30.54,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}dakedo tokidoki yowai ne
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.90,0:02:37.23,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}bokura no negai wa Happy Happy Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.23,0:02:40.67,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}sonna hibi mo Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.11,0:02:48.38,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.97,0:01:39.23,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}We don't know what'll happen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.23,0:01:42.65,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This feels different from a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.65,0:01:44.35,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Something feels different.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.35,0:01:47.97,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm not thinking of it as a punishment game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.97,0:01:51.22,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I still don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.22,0:01:54.62,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though I don't quite feel satisfied with that,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.62,0:02:00.17,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}there's no question that you're important to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.67,0:02:06.43,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}There's nothing in this world that's endless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.54,0:02:10.77,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Isn't it painful having to cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.98,0:02:13.57,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Love's sweet drops, sweet drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.68,0:02:17.12,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to keep dreaming forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.12,0:02:20.25,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to be kinder?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.64,0:02:24.01,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}As long as I'm with you, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.01,0:02:27.23,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you think girls can be strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.23,0:02:30.54,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though we can be weak sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.90,0:02:37.23,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our wish is for happy, happy, happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.23,0:02:40.67,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Those days can also be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.11,0:02:48.38,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.04,0:20:38.53,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}nichiyou no hareta hirusagari
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.20,0:20:42.06,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kyou wa doko e yukou?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.46,0:20:49.02,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kayoi nareta itsumo no michi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.02,0:20:53.62,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mabushiku kagayaite mieru
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.75,0:20:58.97,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}terasu atatakai taiyou to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.99,0:21:04.05,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}tonari ni kimi ga ireba
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.05,0:21:08.13,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mou High High High
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.72,0:21:14.00,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}hashagidasu kimochi ni
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.36,0:21:18.57,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.21,0:21:24.88,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}koe wa dokomademo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.88,0:21:29.04,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mou High High High
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.70,0:21:34.66,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}maiagaru kaze ni nori
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.35,0:21:39.52,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.04,0:21:48.58,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}koe mo tobihaneru
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.04,0:20:38.53,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}It's a sunny Sunday, early in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.20,0:20:42.06,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Where should we go today?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.46,0:20:49.02,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This path I've grown so used to taking
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.02,0:20:53.62,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}seems to be shining brightly,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.75,0:20:58.97,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}as long as the warm sun is shining
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.99,0:21:04.05,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}and you are here beside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.05,0:21:08.13,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.72,0:21:14.00,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I feel like frolicking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.36,0:21:18.57,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.21,0:21:24.88,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our voices can go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.88,0:21:29.04,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.70,0:21:34.66,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm riding on the rising wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.35,0:21:39.52,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.04,0:21:48.58,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even our voices will be bouncing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.52,0:00:04.14,Main Dialog,Newscaster,0000,0000,0000,,Typhoon #13 is maintaining its extremely strong force
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.14,0:00:05.48,Main Dialog,Newscaster,0000,0000,0000,,as it continues making its way north.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.48,0:00:10.28,Main Dialog,Newscaster,0000,0000,0000,,The storm area struck South Daitou Island last night at around 11 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.28,0:00:13.78,Main Dialog,Newscaster,0000,0000,0000,,As of now, the effect on transportation in all areas...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:17.32,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:21.04,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,The TV says the Shinkansen is pooping!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:28.59,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Not pooping! Operating!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.12,0:00:29.88,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Note: unko suru = pooping, unkou suru = in operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.59,0:00:29.88,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Pooping?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:31.38,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Operating!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.38,0:00:35.22,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,They probably said, "The Shinkansen is operating on normal schedules."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.22,0:00:38.35,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That means it's running the same as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.85,0:00:43.39,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,The Shinkansen is pooping!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.82,0:00:52.19,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to go poop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.45,0:00:55.99,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.24,0:01:01.79,Main Dialog,Newscaster,0000,0000,0000,,Typhoon #13 has changed course and is gradually moving east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.79,0:01:03.58,Main Dialog,Newscaster,0000,0000,0000,,It is expected to make landfall in the Toukai area
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.58,0:01:05.83,Main Dialog,Newscaster,0000,0000,0000,,sometime between this evening and night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:08.38,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,She said there's a typhoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.88,0:01:12.00,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's all right. Typhoons come every year...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:13.42,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.38,0:01:16.97,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you out of toilet paper?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.97,0:01:18.55,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,You should see how much I'm making!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.55,0:01:20.51,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Bring a ruler!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.51,0:01:23.52,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Boys are notoriously childish, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.52,0:01:25.98,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I can empathize.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.04,0:03:09.66,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll pick you up early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.66,0:03:10.50,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.54,0:03:13.04,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.09,0:03:16.75,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Awesome, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.75,0:03:18.17,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:20.67,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,See ya later!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.90,0:03:36.52,Main Dialog,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,If you leave just enough space for the circles,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.52,0:03:38.07,Main Dialog,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,it means you've written it in a cool way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.07,0:03:39.03,Main Dialog,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.03,0:03:41.90,Main Dialog,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Sensei, how much is "just enough"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.90,0:03:43.16,Main Dialog,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:44.99,Main Dialog,Boy A,0000,0000,0000,,How many centimeters? How many millimeters?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.71,0:03:56.63,Main Dialog,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to draw these circles!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.63,0:03:58.34,Main Dialog,Class,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.55,0:04:02.51,Main Dialog,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,All right, the rest will be your homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.51,0:04:06.76,Main Dialog,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,For the next activity, all the first-graders are going to draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.76,0:04:09.39,Main Dialog,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,Meet up outside in front of your own morning glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.39,0:04:10.68,Main Dialog,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.68,0:04:12.35,Main Dialog,Class,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.40,0:04:26.24,Main Dialog,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,Sandbags are that heavy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.24,0:04:28.83,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's still morning, and I'm already beat...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.83,0:04:32.20,Main Dialog,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,And it had to be on a day like today when we've got tons of samples to ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.12,0:04:36.33,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.17,0:04:39.30,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.38,0:04:43.01,Main Dialog,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,My kids' educational insurance...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.05,0:04:46.30,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Your kids are still babies!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.30,0:04:49.47,Main Dialog,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,If I waited until they got bigger, the insurance wouldn't mean a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.47,0:04:51.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,G-Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.89,0:04:54.39,Main Dialog,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,We're enrolled too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.39,0:04:57.81,Main Dialog,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,But since it's my kid, university might be impossible after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.81,0:05:00.82,Main Dialog,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,We have two, so it's pretty tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.82,0:05:04.82,Main Dialog,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,Ours is still really small, so we have ridiculous day care fees, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.82,0:05:06.95,Main Dialog,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,His clothes become too small almost instantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.95,0:05:09.78,Main Dialog,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,Well, we're only contract employees, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.78,0:05:14.46,Main Dialog,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,it helps that the welfare pension program and health insurance are included.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.46,0:05:16.96,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,How about life insurance?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:18.96,Main Dialog,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,My wife took care of that behind my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:21.63,Main Dialog,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,For mine, the payout is decent if I kick the bucket,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.63,0:05:23.51,Main Dialog,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,but she has universal life insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.51,0:05:25.09,Main Dialog,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,The basic one...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.13,0:05:29.14,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You guys really are dads, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.14,0:05:30.64,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.64,0:05:33.06,Main Dialog,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing to be impressed about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:36.94,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder how much insurance costs...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.56,0:05:40.73,Main Dialog,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,The brat next door is so frickin' noisy, we wanna move,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.73,0:05:42.40,Main Dialog,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,but the money just ain't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.40,0:05:46.28,Main Dialog,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I don't even know what I'm working for...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.07,0:05:48.61,Main Dialog,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,Take a good look at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.61,0:05:50.41,Main Dialog,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,If you get married, this is what happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.49,0:05:53.83,Main Dialog,Mayunashi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have a girlfriend, so no danger of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.33,0:05:57.08,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,They're always complaining, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.17,0:06:01.96,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Deep down, there's a sense of security.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.42,0:06:07.59,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't imagine them becoming like Rin's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.28,0:06:28.74,Main Dialog,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.70,0:06:31.78,Main Dialog,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Sit down and draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:40.71,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.01,0:06:47.63,Main Dialog,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,What about your drawing board?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.63,0:06:50.88,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Eh... The ground is flat, so I don't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.39,0:06:53.18,Main Dialog,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,That's no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.18,0:06:56.02,Main Dialog,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,When I tell you to bring something, you bring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.02,0:06:58.02,Main Dialog,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Get it right now! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.52,0:07:05.77,Main Dialog,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, your drawing is really good, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.77,0:07:07.40,Main Dialog,Girl A,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it is! That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.40,0:07:08.74,Main Dialog,Girl A,0000,0000,0000,,It's pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.74,0:07:10.32,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.70,0:07:12.20,Main Dialog,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,That really is good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.70,0:07:17.95,Main Dialog,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,The colors of this flower and this flower are slightly different,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.41,0:07:22.71,Main Dialog,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,and Rin-san's drawing shows that with both bluish and purplish colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:26.21,Main Dialog,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,You have a sharp eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.01,0:07:35.85,Main Dialog,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun and those boys are wandering around again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.31,0:07:43.02,Main Dialog,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.52,0:07:45.65,Main Dialog,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, it's drawing time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:50.19,Main Dialog,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-san, your morning glories are looking splendid!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.82,0:07:53.86,Main Dialog,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,It would be a waste not to sketch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.86,0:07:56.16,Main Dialog,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-san, do you like drawing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.28,0:07:58.83,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.33,0:08:01.12,Main Dialog,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Tatsumi-sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.54,0:08:04.25,Main Dialog,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in charge of this boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.25,0:08:08.09,Main Dialog,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-san, why do you always, always disturb everyone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.09,0:08:10.17,Main Dialog,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Now sit down and draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.17,0:08:11.67,Main Dialog,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,And don't make a weird face!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.02,0:08:28.27,Main Dialog,Boy B,0000,0000,0000,,I got Kouki's hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.27,0:08:29.19,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.90,0:08:34.11,Main Dialog,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Kouki-san! Boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.11,0:08:35.32,Main Dialog,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Stop fooling around!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.32,0:08:36.20,Main Dialog,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.70,0:08:38.66,Main Dialog,Boy B,0000,0000,0000,,I got it! I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.46,0:08:44.54,Main Dialog,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.00,0:08:50.05,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.05,0:08:52.38,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sit down and draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.38,0:08:53.51,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Don't let them get you in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.39,0:09:01.43,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.36,0:09:15.61,Main Dialog,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,That was incredible, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.61,0:09:20.49,Main Dialog,Girl A,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun always does strange stuff, and he's scary when he loses his temper.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.03,0:09:23.45,Main Dialog,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, he'll bully you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.45,0:09:28.00,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No, he won't! After all, we went to the same nursery school.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.58,0:09:30.21,Main Dialog,Girl A,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.64,0:09:48.23,Main Dialog,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,They're late...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.82,0:09:57.36,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You guys pick up your kids at 6 too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.36,0:09:59.87,Main Dialog,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Cutting it close today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.28,0:10:01.58,Main Dialog,Mayunashi,0000,0000,0000,,Here they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.16,0:10:07.92,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,All right! Let's get it done in one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.92,0:10:09.00,Main Dialog,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.84,0:10:18.34,Main Dialog,Instructors 1 and 2,0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.76,0:10:21.05,Main Dialog,Instructor 2,0000,0000,0000,,You got a little wet, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.05,0:10:23.97,Main Dialog,Instructor 1,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! Your father's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.85,0:10:26.14,Main Dialog,Instructor 2,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.81,0:10:28.77,Main Dialog,Instructor 1,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.77,0:10:30.77,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.27,0:10:33.15,Main Dialog,Instructor 1,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go get Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.44,0:10:36.49,Main Dialog,Instructor 2,0000,0000,0000,,The wind's really picked up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.49,0:10:40.28,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. I wish I could've gotten here earlier, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.28,0:10:41.91,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Am I the last?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.91,0:10:43.87,Main Dialog,Instructor 2,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun is here, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.87,0:10:45.20,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.12,0:10:47.45,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,There's a storm, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.45,0:10:49.75,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. It's really coming down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.93,0:11:02.30,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.30,0:11:02.97,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.22,0:11:05.97,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,An umbrella's flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.43,0:11:07.77,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.14,0:11:09.39,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-uh. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.11,0:11:15.52,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.82,0:11:18.61,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,See you later, Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.46,0:11:37.17,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Want to walk home together?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.46,0:11:37.17,Alt,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Let's walk home together!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.97,0:11:40.80,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:47.14,Main Dialog,Instructor 2,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. Since it's already been decided, something like that is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.14,0:11:51.56,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I know. But the wind is only going to keep getting stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.56,0:11:54.90,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,so let me try calling Nitani-san to see if it would be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:58.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Then, just to confirm, can I hand the phone over to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.61,0:12:01.95,Main Dialog,Instructor 2,0000,0000,0000,,Um, in that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.95,0:12:04.36,Main Dialog,Instructor 1,0000,0000,0000,,We can go home early too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.36,0:12:05.45,Main Dialog,Instructor 2,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.53,0:12:08.91,Main Dialog,Instructors 1 and 2,0000,0000,0000,,Well, we were just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.64,0:12:31.77,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.77,0:12:32.94,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.44,0:12:34.39,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.36,0:12:44.74,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.74,0:12:46.45,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Get behind me and follow along!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.00,0:12:55.42,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.29,0:12:58.42,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll bring you a towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.96,0:13:01.00,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,The storm windows!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.56,0:13:17.02,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Cool! Let me do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.40,0:13:21.61,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Careful. Don't pinch your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.95,0:13:30.08,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It's dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.04,0:13:44.05,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,You know, it's kind of like a secret base!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.18,0:13:49.89,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It's in my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.89,0:13:51.85,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to rinse it off now, so don't open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.85,0:13:59.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,All right, dry the rest yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.74,0:14:06.86,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, your back is huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.70,0:14:11.95,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.95,0:14:16.62,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening! It's Nitani!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.58,0:14:19.92,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I'll be right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.05,0:14:26.63,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,So you {\i1}were{\i0} able to get off work early...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.63,0:14:29.05,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I feel like I overstepped my bounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.05,0:14:32.51,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all! It was a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.51,0:14:35.72,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. Kouki got soaked on the way here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.72,0:14:39.90,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Really, for anything and everything, I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.45,0:14:50.16,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That looks good on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.57,0:14:55.20,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, let me borrow yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.20,0:14:57.58,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,That again?! It's "Daikichi-san," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.58,0:14:59.79,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,He said "Daikichi" is fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.79,0:15:03.21,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I'm more comfortable with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.21,0:15:04.00,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.00,0:15:06.34,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Calling Daikichi "Daikichi" is fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.60,0:15:17.10,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, you're good at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.10,0:15:18.81,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I can use a knife, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.94,0:15:21.69,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You're already a young lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.69,0:15:23.56,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi does the fire, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.56,0:15:24.73,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.03,0:15:29.78,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You never help out...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.78,0:15:31.11,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'll cut too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.53,0:15:33.91,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll lend you my knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.33,0:15:41.29,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no! Onions are dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.29,0:15:44.63,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Don't touch! Wash your eyes right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.92,0:15:47.42,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.34,0:15:48.46,Alt,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no! I'm crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.30,0:15:57.10,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're making hamburger patties...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.10,0:15:58.31,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.85,0:16:01.18,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It looks delicious, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.81,0:16:04.65,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,These are kind of strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.65,0:16:07.11,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,They're not strange! Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.44,0:16:10.65,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I'm sure they'll taste fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.65,0:16:14.16,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! The eggs are boiled!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:15.74,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Please peel them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.32,0:16:17.74,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.87,0:16:24.71,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.71,0:16:25.88,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You're so good at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.50,0:16:29.13,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That Rin is in such high spirits...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.88,0:16:35.43,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, do you love your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.97,0:16:42.23,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,If only she weren't such an old nag...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.65,0:16:51.36,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,There's a sense of security here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.07,0:16:56.78,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,This one's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.78,0:16:58.87,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,What about giving thanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.00,0:17:04.41,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.41,0:17:06.42,Main Dialog,All,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.76,0:17:21.81,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, use your chopsticks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.81,0:17:23.73,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I know, I'm just getting it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.49,0:17:37.86,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's good, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.86,0:17:39.45,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It really is!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.45,0:17:41.66,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Food tastes better when we eat it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.24,0:17:44.79,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat here again tomorrow night!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.79,0:17:46.08,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:17:58.01,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.01,0:17:59.59,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll finish up later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.05,0:18:00.97,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.31,0:18:08.52,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,And then it hit him right on the head!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.61,0:18:12.52,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,He's so excited...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.52,0:18:16.24,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I was never able to give him this kind of opportunity until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.24,0:18:19.11,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so happy about this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.11,0:18:20.82,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.82,0:18:23.49,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I didn't... I need to thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.45,0:18:27.58,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sensei said we didn't need those circles!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.58,0:18:29.92,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Being able to see that face...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:32.71,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad I got off work early.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.96,0:18:37.47,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's raising a child alone, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.88,0:18:41.43,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Come here a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.43,0:18:42.85,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,All right...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.44,0:18:52.15,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I think it's about time...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.15,0:18:53.82,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Shall I call a taxi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.82,0:18:56.19,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.65,0:19:00.16,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you stay over?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.20,0:19:03.33,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.33,0:19:05.95,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,After all, Reina-chan and her mom stayed over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.95,0:19:07.66,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That was different!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.33,0:19:13.25,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,See ya tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.25,0:19:14.67,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.67,0:19:15.84,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.84,0:19:18.09,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.51,0:19:20.93,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.93,0:19:23.35,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We had fun, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.35,0:19:24.05,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.89,0:19:25.56,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.52,0:20:13.56,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.34,0:22:05.59,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The typhoon left, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.59,0:22:07.01,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.01,0:22:11.05,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.05,0:22:13.18,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun is here already!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.18,0:22:15.14,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,He's early again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.23,0:22:18.10,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Come on in!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.10,0:22:19.94,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.56,0:22:23.11,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.56,0:22:23.11,Alt,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.90,0:22:30.91,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to open the storm windows...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.04,0:22:39.92,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Not a cloud in the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.42,0:22:42.25,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.92,0:22:44.67,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, we're going to be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.67,0:22:47.01,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,See ya later!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.53,0:23:17.20,Episode Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(510,0)\pos(642,275)}Episode 10
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.53,0:23:17.20,Episode Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(510,0)\an8\pos(642,440)}Stomach Flu
